& [ExistingPrimitiveReconciliation] avoids a parallel language
  + ProcessInstanceState remains the execution frame with definition region instruction index typed local state lifecycle wait state logical time frontiers and budgets
  + SerializedContinuation remains one yielded or waiting process continuation with no native stack capture
  + the existing CPPE scheduler remains the only interpreter for bind inspect compare branch select map emit receive yield wait reactivate join return and fault

& [CheckpointSolution] serializes the complete scheduler frontier
  + CoordinationCheckpoint binds exact catalogue procedure IR admission request and initial session inputs
  + process states steps continuations active references messages delivery pending reactivation returns trace clock and session are retained
  + slice index and predecessor digest expose checkpoint trajectory without entering semantic execution trace
  + canonical digest covers every field except itself and strict JSON plus generated schema reject ambient additions

& [StepperSolution] distinguishes caller chunking from program budgets
  + begin_coordination_checkpoint validates existing gates and initializes the same genesis state as the compatibility path
  + advance_coordination_checkpoint accepts one positive process-or-scheduler step ceiling
  + caller ceiling produces Paused with one successor checkpoint while global program bounds produce the existing terminal BudgetRefused outcome
  + return or fault produces one existing CoordinationOutcome and no checkpoint

& [ValidationSolution] refuses false trajectories
  + each advance reruns original input gates and compares every lineage digest
  + process state identity program cursor bounds and map ownership are recomputed
  + continuation digest active state messages frontiers pending wake returns steps and trace predecessor chain are checked
  + changed request or session direct digest corruption and rehashed invalid nested structures fail before advancement

& [CompatibilitySolution] keeps one semantic implementation
  + coordinate_catalogued_procedure preserves its signature and typed invalid-input result
  + compatibility and sliced paths call the same initializer and drive loop
  + quotas one two four mixed one-two-four and sixty-four reach one byte-equal fifteen-step terminal result
  + slice checkpoints are host transport state and add no semantic trace events

& [Boundary] is pure execution reentry P0
  + no logical call stack subroutine operation parser IDE MCP ledger persistence provider llama.cpp hidden state authentication or effect behavior is added
  + digest equality is content binding rather than producer identity or truth proof

